# Brick plate 1: a 1 x 2 plate of peach toy-brick plastic (toy_plastic_peach), 0.96 m long, 0.48 m wide and 0.2 m tall (60 times life size): a flat slab
# with two round studs on top. Ground clutter: no collider, lying on the floor.
format 1

# An eighth of the vertices its size would give it: a small plain slab
Detail detail=0.35
    Material material=toy_plastic_peach
        Union
            Translate translation=(0, 0.06, 0)
                RoundBox size=(0.48, 0.06, 0.24) roundness=0.02
            SymmetryX
                Translate translation=(0.24, 0.16, 0)
                    RoundedCylinder radius=0.145 roundness=0.02 height=0.04
